WEBVTT

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:01.390
I had never had a bad review,

00:01:01.432 --> 00:01:04.560
and I lost every single job.

00:01:05.228 --> 00:01:08.356
It's not easy being a transgender woman.

00:01:08.856 --> 00:01:10.691
People sometimes ask,

00:01:10.691 --> 00:01:13.319
"Do you feel 100 percent like a woman?"

00:01:13.694 --> 00:01:16.572
And I say, "Well, if you've talked
to one transgender person,

00:01:16.572 --> 00:01:19.784
you've talked to exactly
one transgender person.

00:01:19.826 --> 00:01:21.953
I can't speak for anybody else."

00:01:22.537 --> 00:01:26.082
I feel 100 percent
like a transgender woman.

00:01:26.707 --> 00:01:28.668
There are things a cisgender woman knows

00:01:28.668 --> 00:01:30.086
I will never know.